sub:assertion {
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/claim/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony> pk:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-overall> .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
        rdfs:label "Riedel-Kruse et al. (2007) & Morelli et al. (2009) zebrafish Delta-Notch delayed Kuramoto phase synchrony, ALD failure, and PRP washout rescue — MorphoEval overall 59.0/100" ;
        dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
        dct:description "Pass 1 baseline assessment of `2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py` (59.3/100). The initial baseline captures the delayed Kuramoto phase-oscillator equation dtheta_i/dt = omega_0 + (kappa/z)*sum_j sin(theta_j(t - tau_c) - theta_i(t)) + xi_i(t) and collective frequency equation Omega = omega_0 - kappa*sin(Omega*tau_c), but requires explicit verification of Morelli et al.'s (2009) linear stability stiffness criterion kappa_eff = kappa*cos(Omega*tau_c) > 0 across attractive in-phase and repulsive anti-phase delay windows, full DAPT pulse-chase simulation of gastrula initiation, Anterior Limit of Defects (ALD ~ 5.5 somites), and Posterior Rescue Point (PRP ~ 14.5 somites after washout at s_out = 9), and bilateral dorsal somite segmentation against the vendored vertebrate embryo SEM specimen (`zebrafish_psm_synchrony_specimen.jpg`). Overall 59.0/100 (faithfulness 57.4, reproducibility 62.8); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 317bc3c; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 62, Morphological realism / specimen match 54, Parameter expressivity 59, Morphometric validation 56, Source and data traceability 66, Code-to-model traceability 60, Reproducibility package 62. Output judged: docs/media/delta_notch_phase_synchrony_comparison.png: rendered output of 2006-riedel-delta-notch-phase-synchrony.py at 317bc3c, image/png, 1227882 B, 2352×1372 px, artifact_sha256 3375f3ba7e7ccb413d9e89b34eea5d67f6f5273d7fd87f1f853c21b3ae4af792 (sha256 3375f3ba7e7ccb413d9e89b34eea5d67f6f5273d7fd87f1f853c21b3ae4af792), spec_fingerprint 3839bc471581fe7db9e5667737685528fa65076d2960ae3e4a7d5372c54a4e07. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 3839bc471581fe7db9e5667737685528fa65076d2960ae3e4a7d5372c54a4e07; artifact_sha256: 3375f3ba7e7ccb413d9e89b34eea5d67f6f5273d7fd87f1f853c21b3ae4af792; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/delta_notch_phase_synchrony/delta_notch_phase_synchrony_reference.json=cb19f0fbe10df59a..., datasets/delta_notch_phase_synchrony/scout_manifest.json=e3250a43b4bc0c22..., datasets/delta_notch_phase_synchrony/zebrafish_psm_synchrony_specimen.jpg=8b80971796cb29e2...}." ;
        dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
        pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
        pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
        pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Add bilateral dorsal somite row DoG peak & inter-somitic cleft segmentation on `datasets/delta_notch_phase_synchrony/zebrafish_psm_synchrony_specimen.jpg` with phase-aligned Pearson r correlation.",
            "remediation needed: Simulate the 2D delayed Kuramoto PSM lattice across gastrula initiation (R_0 = 0.18 -> 0.96), continuous DAPT Notch blockade (ALD = s_in + 5.5 somites), and DAPT pulse-washout rescue (PRP = s_out + 5.5 somites).",
            "remediation needed: Solve the transcendental collective frequency equation Omega = omega_0 - kappa*sin(Omega*tau_c) and verify Morelli et al.'s (2009) linear stability stiffness criterion kappa_eff = kappa*cos(Omega*tau_c) across both attractive in-phase (tau_c = 20.5 min) and repulsive anti-phase (tau_c = 11.0 min) delay windows." ;
        pk:hasScore "0.59"^^xsd:double ;
        pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .
    <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> a pk:Model ;
        rdfs:label "Gemini 4 Argon (primary) + Claude Sonnet 5.5 High (independent second assessor)" ;
        dct:identifier "gemini-4-argon" ;
        prov:actedOnBehalfOf <https://orcid.org/0009-0007-4948-9192> ;
        foaf:homepage <https://deepmind.google> .
}

